ot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $250. It is a multicolored set of balloons attached to a black block\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Anniversary Balloons are only available for two weeks.\n</p><p>This item is functionally identical to the <a href=\"/wiki/Halloween_Balloons\" title=\"Halloween Balloons\">Halloween Balloons</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903112442\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019500/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.774      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   66.774      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2135-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903112442 and revision id 21564. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Halloween Balloons","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Anniversary_Balloons.png","Anniversary_ballons.png"]}
